                      {
                        "frontTextStyle": "type1",
                        "frontAlignStyle": "left",
                        "type": "title",
                        "value": "🎁 Bonus Rule for Top 3 Hosts in the UK PK League"
                      },
                      {
                        "frontTextStyle": "default",
                        "frontAlignStyle": "left",
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "Only the Top 3 are eligible to unlock tiered rewards on top of their fixed ranking rewards:\n\n• ≥ 300,000 Beans → +5,000 Beans\n• ≥ 400,000 Beans → +17,000 Beans\n• ≥ 600,000 Beans → +50,000 Beans"
                      },
                      {
                        "frontTextStyle": "default",
                        "frontAlignStyle": "left",
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "📌 Example\n\n• Top 1 with 598,091 Beans → 20,000 (fixed) + 17,000 (bonus) = 37,000 Beans\n\n• Top 2 with 527,033 Beans → 10,000 (fixed) + 17,000 (bonus) = 27,000 Beans\n\n• Top 3 with 310,000 Beans → 8,000 (fixed) + 5,000 (bonus) = 13,000 Beans\n\n• Top 2 with 280,000 Beans → 10,000 (fixed) + 0 (no bonus unlocked) = 10,000 Beans"
                      },
                      {
                        "frontTextStyle": "default",
                        "frontAlignStyle": "left",
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "Receive the following designated gifts to earn points:\n• Glory rose (Gift ID: 4349) — 1 point\n• Treasures (Gift ID: 3915) — 100 points\n• Butterfly Wings (Gift ID: 502019) — 1000 points\n• Music Box (Gift ID: 4785) — 5999 points\n• Love Carriage (Gift ID: 3459) — 29999 points"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "complete": true
                }
              ]
            },
