                        "type": "title",
                        "value": "Kind remind"
                      },
                      {
                        "frontTextStyle": "default",
                        "frontAlignStyle": "left",
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "• Earn 100 points for each completed valid PK (counts only toward daily tasks, not the ranking leaderboard), up to 500 points per day\n• Receive the following designated gifts to earn points:\n\n• Glory rose (Gift ID: 4349) — 1 point\n• Treasures (Gift ID: 3915) — 100 points\n• Butterfly Wings (Gift ID: 502019) — 1000 points\n• Music Box (Gift ID: 4785) — 5999 points\n• Love Carriage (Gift ID: 3459) — 29999 points"
                      },
                      {
                        "frontTextStyle": "default",
                        "frontAlignStyle": "left",
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "🎯 Task Reward Inventory Notice\nEach reward level is subject to limited inventory and will be distributed on a first-come, first-served basis. Once the daily inventory for a level is exhausted, no additional rewards will be granted for that tier.\n\n📦 Inventory per level:\n• Lv.1 — 50 available\n• Lv.2 — 30 available\n• Lv.3 — 15 available\n• Lv.4 — 5 available\n• Lv.5 — 3 available\n\nPlease complete your tasks early each day to secure your rewards!"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "type": "paragraph",
