      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "formData": {
          "textContent": [
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "type1",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "title",
              "value": "UK PK league & Rules"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Event Duration: \nJuly 24, 2025, 00:00 – July 31, 2025, 23:59 (UK Time)\nEligible Participants: \nSelected signed UK hosts"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "🚀Activity 1: Daily Tasks\nHosts can earn points through receiving gifts and participating in PK battles to unlock rewards. There are five task levels each day, with a maximum daily reward of 11,380 Beans.\n\nExample:\n• Complete Lv1 with 2,000 total points\n• Complete Lv2 with an additional 3,500 points (5,500 cumulative points)\n\n🎯 Task Reward Inventory Notice\nEach reward level is subject to limited inventory and will be distributed on a first-come, first-served basis. Once the daily inventory for a level is exhausted, no additional rewards will be granted for that tier.\n"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "🔥Activity 2: Ranking Leaderboard\nHosts will be ranked based on the total points earned during the event. Top-ranking hosts will receive additional rewards (see ranking rewards chart for details)."
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "How to Earn Points:"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "fill",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Earn 100 points for each completed valid PK (counts only toward daily tasks, not the ranking leaderboard), up to 500 points per day"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Receive the following designated gifts to earn points:\n• Glory rose (Gift ID: 4349) — 1 point\n• Treasures (Gift ID: 3915) — 100 points\n• Butterfly Wings (Gift ID: 502019) — 1000 points\n• Music Box (Gift ID: 4785) — 5999 points\n• Love Carriage (Gift ID: 3459) — 29999 points"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Kind Reminder:\nOnly gifts received from users located in the following countries will be counted:\nUK, Ireland, Australia, New Zealand, USA, Canada"
            }
          ]
        },
